text = "Welcome, Felxi092, to the [b][u]SubMariner[/u][/b] security management console.

Using this interface, authorized personnel may
  	 Review security camera footage and attached audio transcripts
  	 View up-to-date facility floor plans
  	 [s]Manage security counter-measures[/s]
       	 [u]1642/11/15 03:12[/u] Control matrix deactivated by external override

[u]Please note:[/u] starting 1642/01/01, to preserve storage longevity, security cameras will only capture snapshots [u]once every ten seconds[/u], and only if motion is detected. All data before that point has been wiped.
"

